                                                "sense_id": "af47a153-cb14-3c5f-876c-23bc3aad2af0",
                                                "text": "The server is unstable, we need to rollback the changes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76604087-234a-3450-ab9a-553688546cd8",
                                        "entry_id": "568b4eea-f650-3abf-a5a1-18593f8f6dfc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reduce thrust without having been commanded to do so."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2fb890d-eb10-460b-a078-cf989bbfa3a1",
                                                "sense_id": "76604087-234a-3450-ab9a-553688546cd8",
                                                "text": "The first test involved placing the restriction immediately upstream of the FOHE. As it was known that the engine would almost certainly rollback during the first acceleration attempt, only the fourth accident acceleration was attempted: the rollback occurred as predicted. Testing was also conducted with the restriction at the LP pump inlet, with the rollback also occurring as predicted during the fourth acceleration."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
